hadiths[3]{hadithnumber,text}:
"91","[AI-translation] Imepokelewa kutoka kwa Sabrah al-Juhani (Allah amridhie) kwamba Mtume wa Allah (Swalla Allahu 'alayhi wa sallam) amekataza ndoa [ya muda] (mut'a) akasema: ((Tahadharini! Hii [mut'a] imeharamishwa kwenu kuanzia siku yenu hii mpaka Siku ya Kiyama. Na yule aliyetoa kitu asikirudishe))."
"92","[AI-translation] Anas ibn Malik (Allah amridhie) amesema kwamba Mtume wa Allah (Swalla Allahu 'alayhi wa sallam) amesema: ((Kila dini ina sifa bainifu, na sifa bainifu ya Uislamu ni hayaa [aibu]))."
"93","[AI-translation] Rabi' ibn Sabrah al-Juhani amesema kwamba baba yake alisema: Nilifunga ndoa ya Mut'a na mwanamke wa Banu Amir kwa mavazi mawili mekundu wakati wa Mtume wa Allah (Swalla Allahu 'alayhi wa sallam), kisha Mtume wa Allah (Swalla Allahu 'alayhi wa sallam) alitukataza ndoa ya Mut'a. Muhammad ibn Muslim akasema: Nilimsikia Rabi' ibn Sabrah akimsimulia haya Umar ibn Abd al-Aziz (Allah amrehemu) nami nimekaa nao."
